user.description:
The integration talks to your inverter through an RS485-to-Ethernet gateway (Modbus TCP, port 502). Your network was scanned for it (read-only; nothing is written).

{scan_result}

Next you will set up your tariff's peak hours, then choose read-only or read-write. No gateway yet, or not sure how to wire it? See the [wiring and setup guide]({guide_url}).
